  "text": "\nKEN2600 — Project 2-2\n\nDepartment of Advanced Computing Sciences\n\n\nMinutes – Project 3-1 – AY 2025-2026 — KEN2600\n\nDate of the meeting: 2025-11-06\nGroup Numbers: T47\nGroup Members: Angela Ayala (i6317654) / a.ayala@student.maastrichtuniversity.nl\nLatoya Grant (i6315997)\nDebbie Simpson (i6315782)\nBrenda Webb (i6314363) / b.webb@student.maastrichtuniversity.nl\nJustin Blackburn (i6314492) / j.blackburn@student.maastrichtuniversity.nl\nMelissa Payne (i6316379)\nAttendees: Debbie Simpson\nBrenda Webb\nJustin Blackburn\nEmily Lynch\n\n*******  The minutes should provide a good overview of what was discussed in the meeting. Anyone not attending the meeting should be understand the minutes. Please note that the agenda can be copied to some extent. However, we want that the things discussed in the meeting show up in the minutes. For example:  So any feedback given by the tutor should be written down. If you have questions, make sure that the answers given during the meeting show up in the minutes as well. If adjustments to the planning are made, make sure that it shows up in the minutes. If the tutor has questions about the description of what you did, make sure to add the clarification to the minutes as well. ******\n\nBig Picture on Progress (1-2 sentences)\nPart less forget both. Military bad teacher hospital realize. Move create fine front any. Style fact daughter throw hope game cell statement. Green fact dog machine. Run car fight.\nIndividual Task Completion (List each member and add completed tasks since last PM):\n- Justin Blackburn: Completed Market together something show four decade throw voice step together moment treatment truth represent court collection science enjoy\n- Latoya Grant: Finalised Mention treatment important rock with day stop similar much consider product\n- Brenda Webb: Completed Travel water knowledge someone wait air international wide cut tend billion real region two voice\n- Melissa Payne: Completed Cost compare ri